 "words_heard": 240,
 "words": 247,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The day was long on the grassy hill, the sun was sinking low",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five thousand hungry people and nowhere else to go",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Send them to the villages, the twelve said, let them go and buy their bread",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You give them something to eat, the Master simply said",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Andrew found a little boy with a basket at his side",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five barley loaves and two small fish was all he could provide",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But what is that among so many? Andrew asked aloud",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring them here to me, said Jesus, and he looked out on the crowd",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five loaves and two fish",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Master's hands",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked up to heaven, gave thanks and broke the bread",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And every one was fed",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They all ate and were satisfied",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Twelve baskets left besides",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Have the people sit, he said, there was plenty of green grass",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He broke the bread and gave it out to every hand to pass",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From hand to hand it did not end, and no one could say how",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gather up the leftover pieces, so that nothing is wasted now",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What is that among so many?",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring them here to me",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Little in a boy's two hands",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Was plenty there for all to see",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
